                                                "sense_id": "e5db5b56-f137-3227-a261-a55b500ad8c7",
                                                "text": "Legally, I think you are covered, but there are angry guys with baseball bats outside."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e657240c-176a-471e-b484-213a96968816",
                                                "sense_id": "e5db5b56-f137-3227-a261-a55b500ad8c7",
                                                "text": "After filing paperwork to change his name, the rapper, born Kanye Omari West, finally got what he asked for, and will be legally known as “Ye.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
